    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d953">

                <pb facs="0985" n="865" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg865"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Foreign Affairs of Norway to the
                        Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-11-01"><hi rendition="#italic">November 1,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Norwegian Government presents heartiest thanks for kind telegram 30 October.
                    Hauge ordered to go Washington immediately as chargé d’affaires.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lövland</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
